# Safety net only — real customer records must never be created inside
# this repository at all (see docs/LAUNCH-DAY-RUNBOOK-v0.1.md and
# docs/customer-ops/README.md: they live in private storage, outside
# HerGotSystems/EMVYCHECK). These patterns exist in case an order
# working directory is ever accidentally created inside a local
# checkout of this repo, so it can never be accidentally committed.
# This is a fallback, not the intended workflow.

# Order folders, per the docs/customer-ops naming convention
# (e.g. EC-2026-001_Customer_Project/)
EC-20[0-9][0-9]-*/

# Obvious local-only customer-data directory names
/customer-records/
/private/
